  "details": "This is minor, but I figured I'd report it anyway as I figure like all bugs it should eventually be fixed.\n\nIn the VRChat menu UI, if you search for a user who you've already friended, in the search results they'll always be online, even if they're truly offline.\n\nAdditionally, if a user changes their username, you can still search for them by their original username and get both their new username as well as a \"ghost\" of their old profile as well.\n\nVideo of me reproducing the bug:https://youtu.be/B5sliBNlEdY\n\nI think for the sake of privacy, you should make it so that when people change their names, it completely deletes the old name from the database. When people change their names, there's often an anti-stalker reason for doing it.\n\nThat's about it though, thanks for reading.",
