  "title": "[Minor Bug] -- If you search for a user who is already your friend using the search function, they will always appear as \"online\" in that search result. Additionally, users who changed their username still appear in search results under their old name, with a \"ghost profile\" of their old name still appearing as well. (Details with video inside)",
